        "title": "Christmas Edition (2-count)",
        "status": "ACTIVE",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>The CHARM VILLA Christmas Edition (2-count) contains two Goldfish Tea Bags of your selected tea in a Christmas paper box. Choose one of five tea varieties for a small seasonal gift or a pair of tea moments.</p><h3>Choose your tea</h3><ul>\n<li>Rose Oolong Tea: 2 Goldfish Tea Bags of this tea per box.</li>\n<li>Rose &amp; Honey-Scented Black Tea: 2 Goldfish Tea Bags of this tea per box.</li>\n<li>Oriental Beauty Tea (White Tip Oolong): 2 Goldfish Tea Bags of this tea per box.</li>\n<li>Ruby Black Tea (Red Jade / Ruby No.18): 2 Goldfish Tea Bags of this tea per box.</li>\n<li>Jin Xuan Oolong Tea (Golden Lily): 2 Goldfish Tea Bags of this tea per box.</li>\n</ul><h3>Packaging</h3><ul><li>Christmas paper box containing two Goldfish Tea Bags of the selected tea.</li></ul><h3>How to brew</h3><p>Pour 150 mL (about 5 fl oz) of hot water at 95°C (203°F) into your cup. Tear the package fully open at the notch and lift out the Goldfish Tea Bag. Add it to the water, gently submerge it with a teaspoon or stirrer, then let it float. Steep for about 5 minutes. Use a clear glass cup to enjoy the goldfish’s shape.</p>",
